From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: LeadingLight <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 07:52:33 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Outputs: each file an agent wrote, kept as the write left it

Claude's Write and Edit calls that went through, and Codex's completed file changes, keep the file's content (up to 5 MB) with the conversation. GET /v1/conversations/{id}/outputs lists them; .../outputs/{id} is one as it was, after the file changes or its worktree is gone.
---
 internal/box/claudedriver.go  |   9 +-
 internal/box/codexdriver.go   |  15 ++-
 internal/box/conversations.go |   2 +
 internal/box/outputs.go       | 174 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 internal/box/outputs_test.go  |  27 ++++++
 5 files changed, 225 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 internal/box/outputs.go
 create mode 100644 internal/box/outputs_test.go

